00:48:38,181 --> 00:48:44,181
The Predator is a 2018 American science fiction action film directed
by Shane Black, who co-wrote it with Fred Dekker.

11
00:53:30,000 --> 00:53:36,000
It is the fourth installment in the Predator
franchise, following Predators (2010).

12
00:58:21,818 --> 00:58:27,818
The film stars Boyd Holbrook, Trevante Rhodes, Jacob Tremblay, Keegan-Michael
Key, Olivia Munn, Thomas Jane, Alfie Allen, and Sterling K.

13
01:03:13,636 --> 01:03:19,636
It follows a group of PTSD-afflicted soldiers and a scientist who must team up to fight
off an invading pair of Predators and discover their plans for humankind.

14
01:08:05,454 --> 01:08:11,454
Development of the film was announced in June 2014, with
Black being confirmed as writer and director.

15
01:12:57,272 --> 01:13:03,272
Much of the cast signed on between October 2016 and January 2017.

16
01:17:49,090 --> 01:17:55,090
Principal photography took place in British Columbia from February to June 2017, with the
climax being re-written and re-shot in July 2018 following poor test screenings.

17
01:22:40,909 --> 01:22:46,909
The Predator premiered at the Toronto International Film Festival on September 6, 2018,
and was released in the United States on September 14, by 20th Century Fox.

18
01:27:32,727 --> 01:27:38,727
The film received generally negative reviews from critics and
grossed $160 million against a budget of $88 million.

19
01:32:24,545 --> 01:32:30,545
It was followed by a prequel, Prey, released in 2022 and a
sequel, Predator: Badlands released in 2025.

20
01:37:16,363 --> 01:37:22,363
The film explores themes of predator, sequel, alien, creature, alien invasion.

21
01:42:08,181 --> 01:42:14,181
The tone is thought_provoking and intense.
